			<div class="content" id="post-content-4385192">
									

<p>Hey so this is my first SCP. It was born out of a joke about how there's always one more brother in MBMBaM than you expect; and I started toying with the idea of a SCP who's anomalous property is that it duplicates upon being counted. Originally, this was gonna feature an interview with the SCP replicating but then I realised something: how do you get one instance alone in a room?</p>
<p>This was originally gonna be a lot lighter but it didn't feel like it'd work as well as it does in the current form, where you have the relatively light exploration log and then the very dark ending.</p>
<p>Big thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4022320); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4022320&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1576588658" alt="RockTeethMothEyes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4022320)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rockteethmotheyes" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4022320); return false;">RockTeethMothEyes</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5376871); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5376871&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1576588658" alt="gee0765" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5376871)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gee0765" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5376871); return false;">gee0765</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5255688); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1576588658" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5255688); return false;">DrAkimoto</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(776854); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=776854&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1576588658" alt="Tanhony" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=776854)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tanhony" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(776854); return false;">Tanhony</a></span> for critting this; and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tupacofficial" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3101862); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3101862&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1576588658" alt="tupacofficial" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3101862)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tupacofficial" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3101862); return false;">tupacofficial</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2902864); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2902864&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1576588658" alt="MaliceAforethought" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2902864)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/maliceaforethought" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2902864); return false;">MaliceAforethought</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/macwarren" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3741977); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3741977&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1576588658" alt="MacWarren" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3741977)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/macwarren" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3741977); return false;">MacWarren</a></span> for help with the conceptual drafting. Also thanks to my wife who had to keep putting up with me thinking through this at them.</p>
<p>Image source is <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Comedian_Pat_Oates.jpg">here</a></p>
